@HostAddress = http://localhost:5120

GET {{HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Auth: register (stores the returned token in the "token" variable)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Sara Ahmadi",
  "email": "sara@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

###

### Auth: login (stores the returned token in the "token" variable)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sara@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

###

### Auth: current user
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Categories: list (optional ?type=Income|Expense)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/categories?type=Expense
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Categories: create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pets",
  "type": "Expense"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("categoryId", response.body.id);
%}

###

### Categories: rename
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Animals"
}

###

### Categories: delete
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Accounts: list (optional ?includeArchived=true)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Accounts: create (type: Cash, BankAccount, Card, Savings, DigitalWallet, Other)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Main wallet",
  "type": "Cash",
  "initialBalance": 1500000
}

> {%
    client.global.set("accountId", response.body.id);
%}

###

### Accounts: get one (with current balance)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Accounts: update (set isArchived to true to hide it)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Main wallet",
  "type": "Cash",
  "initialBalance": 1500000,
  "isArchived": false
}

###

### Accounts: delete (only accounts without transactions)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Transactions: create an expense (needs an expense category id and an account id)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Expense",
  "amount": 250000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "date": "2026-10-05T09:30:00Z",
  "description": "Lunch with friends"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("transactionId", response.body.id);
%}

###

### Transactions: create an income (needs an income category id)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Income",
  "amount": 30000000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{incomeCategoryId}}",
  "description": "October salary"
}

###

### Transactions: transfer between two accounts (no category)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Transfer",
  "amount": 5000000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "destinationAccountId": "{{otherAccountId}}"
}

###

### Transactions: list with filters and paging
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&type=Expense&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Transactions: get one
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Transactions: update
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Expense",
  "amount": 270000,
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "description": "Lunch with friends (corrected)"
}

###

### Transactions: delete
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Reports: summary (income, expense, net, savings rate, balance). from/to are optional.
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/summary?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Reports: spending (or income) per category
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/category-breakdown?type=Expense&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Reports: income vs expense for the last N months
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/monthly-trend?months=6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Reports: this period compared with the previous one of the same length
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/reports/comparison?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Goals: create
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New laptop",
  "targetAmount": 60000000,
  "deadline": "2027-03-20",
  "description": "Saving for a work laptop"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("goalId", response.body.id);
%}

###

### Goals: list (optional ?status=Active|Completed|Cancelled)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Goals: get one with its contributions
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/goals/{{goalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Goals: update (isCancelled true cancels, false reopens)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/goals/{{goalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New laptop",
  "targetAmount": 65000000,
  "deadline": "2027-03-20",
  "isCancelled": false
}

###

### Goals: add a contribution (returns the goal with its progress)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/goals/{{goalId}}/contributions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000000,
  "note": "October saving"
}

###

### Goals: remove a contribution
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/goals/{{goalId}}/contributions/{{contributionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Goals: delete
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/goals/{{goalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### AI: record a transaction from a sentence (preview: true only shows how it was understood)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/ai/transactions/text
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "دیروز ناهار ۲۵۰ هزار تومان",
  "preview": true
}

###

### AI: record a transaction from a sentence (saved; optional accountId)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/ai/transactions/text
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "حقوق ۳۰ میلیون دریافت شد",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}"
}

###

### AI: record a transaction from a voice recording (multipart; mp3, m4a, wav, webm, ogg, ...)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/ai/transactions/voice
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=VoiceBoundary

--VoiceBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="note.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/mp4

< ./note.m4a
--VoiceBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="preview"

true
--VoiceBoundary--

###

### AI: insights about the period (from/to optional)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/ai/insights?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
